#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pybamm/experiment/step/step_termination.py:docstring
#: of pybamm.experiment.step.step_termination.BaseTermination:1
msgid ""
"Base class for a termination event for an experiment step. To create a "
"custom termination, a class must implement `get_event_expression` to return "
"the symbolic expression for the event. In most cases the class :class:"
